Q3. What are the key features of arraylist ?
 - Dynamic Size
 - Ordered Collection :
                      a. Maintains the insertion order.
                      a. Elements can be accessed by their index.
- Allows Duplicates :
                      a. ArrayList can store duplicate elements.
