Q1. are the key features of LinkedList ?
 - Dynamic Size
 - Ordered Collection :
                      a. Maintains the insertion order.
                      a. Elements can be accessed in the same order as they were inserted.
- Allows Duplicates :
                      a. can store duplicate elements.
